{"notice_id":26535235,"sections":[{"kind":"SettledContract","parent_section_id":"PROCEDURE","section_id":"CON-0001","values":[{"field_id":"DE1-NoticeResult-SettledContract-ContractReference-ID","is_ref":false,"ordinal":0,"scheme":null,"type":"id","value":"1"},{"field_id":"DE1-NoticeResult-SettledContract-ID","is_ref":false,"ordinal":0,"scheme":"contract","type":"id","value":"CON-0001"},{"field_id":"DE1-NoticeResult-SettledContract-IssueDate","ordinal":0,"type":"date","value":"2024-12-16"},{"field_id":"DE1-NoticeResult-SettledContract-Title","lang":"DEU","ordinal":0,"type":"text","value":"Vertrag"}]},{"kind":"ProcurementProjectLot","parent_section_id":"PROCEDURE","section_id":"LOT-0001","values":[{"field_id":"DE1-ProcurementProject-ContractExtension-MaximumNumberNumeric","ordinal":0,"type":"number","unit":null,"value":1.0},{"field_id":"DE1-ProcurementProject-ContractExtension-Renewal-Period-Description","lang":"DEU","ordinal":0,"type":"text","value":"Der Vertrag wird zunächst vom 01.01.2025 bis zum 31.12.2026 geschlossen. Der Vertrag kann sich einmalig um ein weiteres Jahr verlängern. Er verlängert sich einmalig um ein weiteres Jahr, sofern eine der Vertragsparteien der Verlängerung spätestens 6 Monate vor Ablauf der Vertragslaufzeit schriftlich zustimmt und zuvor Einvernehmen über die nach der Vertragsverlängerung zu zahlenden zusätzlichen Entgelte gem. § 8 Abs. 4e des Vertrages erzielt wird. Der Vertrag endet spätestens am 31.12.2027."},{"field_id":"DE1-ProcurementProject-Description","lang":"DEU","ordinal":0,"type":"text","value":"Gegenstand dieses Verfahrens ist die Vergabe eines Auftrages zur Übernahme und Entsorgung von Problemabfällen aus Haushaltungen und Kleingewerbe aus dem Kreis Wesel (Alpen, Dinslaken, Hamminkeln, Hünxe, Kamp-Lintfort, Moers, Neukirchen-Vluyn, Rheinberg, Schermbeck, Sonsbeck, Voerde, Wesel und Xanten) an einer durch den Auftragnehmer zu benennenden Annahmestelle für den Vertragszeitraum 01.01.2025 - 31.12.2026 mit einmaliger Verlängerungsoption."},{"field_id":"DE1-ProcurementProject-ID","is_ref":false,"ordinal":0,"scheme":"internalID","type":"id","value":"VH2024-pp-PA25-26"},{"code":"90500000","field_id":"DE1-ProcurementProject-MainCommodityClassification-ItemClassificationCode","ordinal":0,"scheme":"cpv","type":"classification"},{"field_id":"DE1-ProcurementProject-Name","lang":"DEU","ordinal":0,"type":"text","value":"Übernahme und Entsorgung von Problemabfällen  aus Haushaltungen und Kleingewerbe aus dem Kreis Wesel"},{"code":"services","field_id":"DE1-ProcurementProject-ProcurementTypeCode","list":"contract-nature","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"field_id":"DE1-ProcurementProjectLot-ID","is_ref":false,"ordinal":0,"scheme":"Lot","type":"id","value":"LOT-0001"},{"field_id":"DE1-ProcurementProjectLot-TenderingProcess-GovernmentAgreementConstraintIndicator","ordinal":0,"type":"integer","value":0},{"field_id":"DE1-ProcurementProjectLot-TenderingTerms-AdditionalInformationParty-PartyIdentification-ID","is_ref":true,"ordinal":0,"scheme":null,"type":"id","value":"ORG-0001"},{"field_id":"DE1-TenderingProcess-AuctionTerms-AuctionConstraintIndicator","ordinal":0,"type":"integer","value":0},{"field_id":"DE1-TenderingTerms-AppealTerms-AppealReceiverParty-PartyIdentification-ID","is_ref":true,"ordinal":0,"scheme":"organization","type":"id","value":"ORG-0002"},{"code":"no-eu-funds","field_id":"DE1-TenderingTerms-FundingProgramCode","list":"eu-funded","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"code":"false","field_id":"DE1-TenderingTerms-StrategicProcurement-ApplicableLegalBasis","list":"cvd-scope","ordinal":0,"type":"code"}]},{"kind":"AdditionalCommodityClassification","parent_section_id":"PROCEDURE","section_id":"ND-AdditionalCommodityClassification#0","values":[{"code":"90520000","field_id":"DE1-ProcurementProject-AdditionalCommodityClassification-ItemClassificationCode","ordinal":0,"scheme":"cpv","type":"classification"}]},{"kind":"AdditionalCommodityClassification","parent_section_id":"LOT-0001","section_id":"ND-AdditionalCo